<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Your Apardex admin invitation</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f4f4f4; padding:40px;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:32px;">
    <h2 style="color:#1a1a1a;">Hi {{firstName}},</h2>
    <p style="color:#444;">
      You've been added to the Apardex admin team as
      <strong>{{roleLabel}}</strong>. Sign in with the temporary password below.
    </p>
    <div style="margin:32px 0; padding:20px; background:#f7f7f7; border-radius:6px;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px; color:#888; font-size:13px;">Email</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 20px; color:#1a1a1a; font-size:15px;">{{email}}</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px; color:#888; font-size:13px;">Temporary password</p>
      <p style="margin:0; font-size:22px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; color:#1a1a1a;">{{temporaryPassword}}</p>
    </div>
    <p style="color:#444;">
      You'll be asked to set your own password the first time you sign in. Until
      you do, the rest of the dashboard stays locked.
    </p>
    <p style="color:#888; font-size:13px;">
      If you weren't expecting this invitation, please ignore this email or let
      the Apardex team know.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
